  TutorialSteps:
  - ID: 0
    Message: Use WASD or the directional keys to move the camera
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 1
    Message: Hold down the LEFT MOUSE BUTTON to rotate the camera
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 2
    Message: LEFT CLICK on a UNIT to select it
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 3
    Message: RIGHT CLICK to set a destination for your selected unit
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 4
    Message: Set a TURRET as a destination for your selected unit. If your unit is
      strong enough, it will lift that turret
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 5
    Message: 'While your unit is carrying a turret: set a new destination to drop
      the turret in that point'
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 6
    Message: 'While a specialized UNIT/TURRET is selected: LEFT CLICK on the UPGRADE
      BUTTON to buy an upgrade'
    Events: {fileID: 0}
  - ID: 7
    Message: LEFT CLICK on the pause button to stop the game action. While in this
      mode, you can still select and set destinations for your units
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2a355153ed399934f90e161e221ebd48, type: 2}
  - ID: 7
    Message: LEFT CLICK again on the pause button to resume the action
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2a355153ed399934f90e161e221ebd48, type: 2}
  - ID: 8
    Message: LEFT CLICK on the "Next wave" banner to call the first wave of enemies.
      Prevent them to destroy your castle!
    Events: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0003d6f8efa78084ca5fcfc6757ff6b0, type: 2}
